   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official Store | Pump Hands-Free, Go Anywhere | 28% Faster Pumping Sessions | 240 Min of Battery Per Charge | 7 oz Cups, Fewer Refills | -292 mmHg Strong Suction | Momcozy S12 Pro Breast Pump | Only 4 Parts to Clean | Fits in Your Nursing Bra | Leak-Resistant DoubleFit | Trusted by 6 Million+ Moms | Free 1-on-1 IBCLC Session | FSA/HSA Eligibl | 1-Year Warranty Included | Pump hands-free in your bra with -292 mmHg suction, 3 modes and 9 levels. | Leak resistant DoubleFit flange , a 7 oz cup and only 4 parts to clean | Up to 240 min of quiet 46 dB pumping. FSA/HSA eligible with free shipping | Save 20% sitewide with code BDBW20 . Aug 1 - 7. 1 year warranty included",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYeGRmnEV/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ 奶流/移除量/排空效率/漏奶/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（样本、对照、统计口径齐全），或改为放松叙事+限定语（may help/natural）；内部测试数值（28.2%/10%/70%）补齐前不得公开传播 ▸ 核验 IBCLC/专家身份、参与方式、程序设计依据与 COI 披露后再保留（含 expert-tuned/专家调校/专家程序） ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest",
